      "start_seconds": 204.2,
      "end_seconds": 213.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 77 beats a minute, blood pressure 110 over 75, respiratory rate 15. And And oxygen saturation is 99 percent."
